{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/6e74bb0cb31a162d4ad7f23376f64ab4.avif?t=1757667412\" width=1600 height=241 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca7 Water Simulation &amp; Powder Sandboxel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simulate liquids like lava, petrol, oil, nitro, viruses, fireworks, and more \u2013 each with unique behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy a beautiful underwater sandbox game with up to 200,000 water particles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/8754a77af0f77ef2bb7c8c64c79440b9.poster.avif?t=1757667412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/8754a77af0f77ef2bb7c8c64c79440b9.webm?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/8754a77af0f77ef2bb7c8c64c79440b9.mp4?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/6dfa546ec240677830b7b999ec78bdc7.poster.avif?t=1757667412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/6dfa546ec240677830b7b999ec78bdc7.webm?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/6dfa546ec240677830b7b999ec78bdc7.mp4?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2b Ragdoll People Playground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover the many unpredictable outcomes of ragdoll experiments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use virus liquids to infect them or make them go crazy with chemicals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic gore ragdoll playground: they can walk, drown, burn, or react to your experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/65cc95c98dd2cfbc66c2085b1da0dac3.poster.avif?t=1757667412\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/65cc95c98dd2cfbc66c2085b1da0dac3.webm?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/65cc95c98dd2cfbc66c2085b1da0dac3.mp4?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea4 Ship Sinking Simulator &amp; Floating Sandbox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build ships from scratch or choose from pre-built ones like cargo ships, submarines, and even the Titanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Test their strength against waves, bombs, storms, or tsunamis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Watch ships float, sink, burn, or explode in realistic fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The inbuilt ship sinking simulator is very sophisticated</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Includes 50+ pre-built experiments and machines to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build and test your own ships, vehicles, titanic clones, tanks rockets and share them in the online workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Construct using different materials like wood, rubber or stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/08d6246bfbce4ae047486aeca40402c0.poster.avif?t=1757667412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/08d6246bfbce4ae047486aeca40402c0.webm?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/08d6246bfbce4ae047486aeca40402c0.mp4?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5Gore &amp; Destruction Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use explosives like nukes, grenades, and rockets to smash anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unleash god-powers like airstrikes, tsunamis, or firestorms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose among an arsenal of weapons to wreak havoc against your subjects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/e4b2f1b88088b8393e12115717c0a8c0.poster.avif?t=1757667412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/e4b2f1b88088b8393e12115717c0a8c0.webm?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/e4b2f1b88088b8393e12115717c0a8c0.mp4?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2697\ufe0fAlchemy, Fire &amp; Physics Sandbox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experiment with different elements - like lava with nitro, or fire with petrol and watch how they react with water, like freezing or evaporating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic temperature, fire, and chemical reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Set things on fire and watch it spread; extinguish it with water or freeze it into ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All materials react uniquely \u2013 from flammable boats to explosive ragdolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A deep and detailed destruction simulator game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the game includes many cool firework effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/2933bda3adbfbdb8d3444a15e32b41ad.poster.avif?t=1757667412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/2933bda3adbfbdb8d3444a15e32b41ad.webm?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/extras/2933bda3adbfbdb8d3444a15e32b41ad.mp4?t=1757667412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now have fun and relax while playing in this underwater powder game: build complex boats, machines or simulate chain reactions in this sandboxel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have ideas or issues? Send me an email!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the sandbox game now, build something wild, and let the chaos begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By  (2025)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939240?t=1757667412","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/d6aae9e077573fbf3043cbbe895fd05363a1be99/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757667412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/fbf7721a87891493164b0b921341dc0049fe28e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757667412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939240/fbf7721a87891493164b0b921341dc0049fe28e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757667